@K102_EirinVisitToRemoveInconChip
;
;
LOCALS '= @"「A weird numbness around the bladder? Is that correct?/This could mean that an external factor could be messing up your bladder, causing it to be insensitive./I'll have to scan your body for any possible anomalies.」"
CALL COM616_EIRInSPEAK, LOCALS
WAIT
;NAS: Adds a confirmation
LOCALS '= @"「This will cost ¥10,000. You may be put under anesthetic if I do find something wrong.」"
CALL COM616_EIRInSPEAK, LOCALS
CALL ASK_YN("Agree", "Cancel")
IF RESULT
	RETURN
ELSE
	CALL COM616_CHECK(10000)
	SIF RESULT
		RETURN
ENDIF

PRINTFORMDL %CALLNAME:72% starts to scan your body using magical techniques.
PRINTFORMDW An inquisitive look turns into a sight of concern as it's revealed that there's an abnormal implant inside your bladder.
LOCALS '= @"「Just as I expected. There's an abnormal implant inside your urinary system.」/"
LOCALS += @"「%CALLNAME:MASTER%, hold my hand as I lead you to the dressing room.」"
CALL COM616_EIRINSPEAK, LOCALS
PRINTFORMW You're lead into a dressing room, in which a hospital gown of your size lays on the bench.
LOCALS '= @"「Dress into this hospital gown and report back to the operating room when you're done.」/"
CALL COM616_EIRINSPEAK, LOCALS
WAIT
PRINTFORML You begin to take off your clothes and begin wearing the dress.
PRINTFORMW When you're done, you return to the examination room.
LOCALS '= @"「Lay on this table so I can start the surgery procedure.」/"
LOCALS += @"「I'll see what's this implant in your bladder is all about and try to safely remove it.」/"
LOCALS += @"「You'll be out after a couple of hours since it's not a major surgery.」/"
LOCALS += @"「We'll do everything we can to not leave any long lasting side effects or damage your health in any way.」/"
CALL COM616_EIRINSPEAK, LOCALS, "smile"
WAIT
PRINTFORML You get up onto a surgery table.
PRINTFORML %CALLNAME:72% instructs you to lay down on said table and to remain calm.
PRINTFORMW %HE_SHE(72,1)% puts a respirator on your nose and begins to turn on the machine
LOCALS '= "「Stay still and breath calmly./It'll take quite a bit for the anesthetic to kick in."
IF GETBIT(nPee,1)
LOCALS += "/Also, I'll be putting this urinary catheter on you. Wetting during surgery is quite the common occurrence./It doesn't help that I'll need to work on your urinary system as well."
ENDIF
LOCALS += "」"
CALL COM616_EIRINSPEAK, LOCALS
SIF GETBIT(nPee,1)
CALL EVENT_Loss_U(MASTER,72,"catherer", @"had a catheter forcefully inserted during surgery with %CALLNAME:72%")
WAIT
PRINTFORMW You slowly being to fall asleep...
PRINTFORMW ...
PRINTFORMW ..
PRINTFORMW .
PRINTL
CALL K102_EirinRemovesInconChip(CFLAG:102:3100)

LOCALS '= @"「Make sure you sleep this off well afterwards.」"
CALL COM616_EIRINSPEAK, LOCALS
WAIT

CALL COM616_PAY(10000)
RETURN

